ent","l'analyse","comportementale","et","la","publicite","ciblee","ouvrir","22","big","brother","watch","et","autres","c","royaume-uni","cedh","grande","chambre","25","mai","2021","garanties","face","a","l'interception","en","vrac","couche","snowden","du","panneau","aller","chercher","violations","des","art","8","et","10","l'interception","en","vrac","exige","des","garanties","de","bout","en","bout","ouvrir","23","aclu","v","clapper","785","f","3d","787","2e","circuit","7","mai","2015","source","primaire","limites","legales","de","la","collecte","de","metadonnees","couche","snowden","du","panneau","aller","chercher","le","programme","telephonique","en","vrac","n'etait","pas","autorise","par","la","section","215","ouvrir"],"empreinte":"5bfebef4ebe6eb985fedcd326b22f4f1c823e377224055808785c432df0488fe","actions":[{"libelle":"Consulter les 23 décisions","page":"decisions.html","ancre":"decisions-registre","fragment":"Les 23 décisions — Canada, Québec, Europe, États-Unis","mots":["consulter","23","decisions","canada","quebec","europe","etats-unis"]}],"merkle":{"feuille":60,"chemin":[{"cote":"droite","digest":"b68a56b1a7af09b8a85360a6cf5213462c9288ae2d36e5fb3f13921dbc8ce7f1"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"fc4383c2dc5c4c071ab400f273e95687dbc881646e15eb2a5972e7544e8772cb"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"784e2184bb40a29549772838107d3de7e56916bcecf86ef5bf4e5fb78680686d"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"a37f23cfa9248d54fbcea9a8729d596f4be8c258418d5d38d48a4916ccfced3e"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"cf5b268a319349c3b584ae05e70edc968c1422cb7f9649a2448c4d63e9e3bd99"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"55fee940734b458d1c9e3898cc0692f3b5cd586083757167b16b274ce87f2817"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"ba45ce6ff6c9459539eb8e36f654bb04efdfb0657b1f96d714f80e130f40fe28"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"1b65fe30398d27092aa2f9c3f7676704539d0c46eccad31cb93550bae8d57f8b"}]}},{"id":61,"page":"decisions.html","ancre":"decisions-attente","titre":"La liste d’attente — trois décisions nommées, pas admises","panneau":"Le registre des décisions","texte":"! La liste d’attente — trois décisions nommées, pas admises Elles sont réelles ou alléguées, souvent citées — et exclues de ce registre tant que leur pièce n'est pas lue, chacune avec sa borne : CPVP c. Facebook, demande à la Cour fédérale (2020) — annoncée par le CPVP après le refus de Facebook de suivre les recommandations du n° 1 ; aucun jugement au fond n'a été retrouvé à la source primaire dans le ratissage. Elle entrera avec sa borne si un jugement existe. Google Inc. c. Equustek Solutions Inc., 2017 CSC 34 (injonction mondiale de déréférencement) — décision réelle et souvent citée, mais non revérifiée à la source primaire dans ce ratissage ; exclue plutôt que citée de mémoire. À vérifier, puis à verser. CNPD du Luxembourg c. Amazon (746 M€, 16 juillet 2021) — la décision n'est pas publique ; l'amende est établie par le dépôt SEC d'Amazon et traitée à la fiche Amazon. Exclue du registre, qui n'admet que des textes lisibles par l'utilisateur. Écart nommé : la spec de cette version prévoyait un « registre des inconnus » comme surface propre ; il n'existe pas encore dans le site. En attendant sa construction, la liste d’attente publique ci-dessus tient son rôle — c'est la forme que le rapport lui-même propose — et les trois exclues y sont nommées au lieu d'être tues.","mots":["la","liste","d","attente","trois","decisions","nommees","pas","admises","elles","sont","reelles","ou","alleguees","souvent","citees","et","exclues","de","ce","registre","tant","que","leur","piece","n'est","pas","lue","chacune","avec","sa","borne","cpvp","c","facebook","demande","a","la","cour","federale","2020","annoncee","par","le","cpvp","apres","le","refus","de","facebook","de","suivre","les","recommandations","du","n","1","aucun","jugement","au","fond","n'a","ete","retrouve","a","la","source","primaire","dans","le","ratissage","elle","entrera","avec","sa","borne","si","un","jugement","existe","google","inc","c","equustek","solutions","inc","2017","csc","34","in